							<br><br><div class="text">Class B Common Stock</div></td></tr><tr class="tableClass"><td width="8%" class="tableClassNoBorderAlignCenter">(b)</td><td width="92%" class="tableClassNoBorder">Name of Issuer:
							<br><br><div class="text">Fox Corporation</div></td></tr><tr><td width="8%" class="tableClassNoBorderAlignCenter">(c)</td><td width="92%" class="tableClassNoBorder">Address of Issuer's Principal Executive Offices:
